B.aqf=new A.ck("toss","Toss",B.fJ,"When you succeed on a melee attack against a target smaller than you, force them to dash {Level /4} spaces. [Reaction] During ally turns, you may spend your reaction to toss an adjacent willing ally, dashing them to a free space within {Level +1}. You may throw them twice as far, if you do, they must make a dex defense or they take {their vitality d12} damage and are knocked prone.",B.adg)
