B.aCn=new A.d5("universal_absorbing","Absorbing","Whenever you damage shields with these abilities attacks, gain half that much shield. If you attack multiple targets, only gain shield from damage from one target, and do not gain shield from bonus damage.")
B.aCm=new A.d5("universal_accurate","Accurate","Gain a +1 to attack results with this ability.")
B.aCA=new A.d5("universal_acid","Acid","On Success, give the target {Source /3}d6 Burn vs Int. While they have this burn, attacks against them ignore resistance.")
B.aCu=new A.d5("universal_bleeding","Bleeding","On Success: The target gains {Half Source}d6 Bleed. You may give yourself or an ally range 1, {Half Source}d6 Bleed to give the targets {Source}d6 bleed instead.")
B.aCy=new A.d5("universal_cold","Cold","On Success, give the target {Source /3} Cold.")
B.aCH=new A.d5("universal_combo","Combo","On Success, gain +1d6 damage for each time you have succeeded in attacking with this ability without failing up to a Max of {Source d6}. On failure you lose your combo bonus and start over. Abilities that target multiple creatures do not increase combo per target, only per attack.")
B.aCq=new A.d5("universal_death","Death","On Success, also deal the damage to a character range 4 who wasn\u2019t targeted by the ability. No other effects from the ability are applied. You must target a character with this effect, and may target yourself or allies. If there is no valid character, you must target yourself and the damage ignores shield and resistance. ")
B.aCo=new A.d5("universal_earth","Earth","On Success, the target\u2019s speed is reduced by {Half Source} and you gain a +1 to defense results until the start of your next turn. On Problems, you may gain a +1 to defense results and -2 speed until the start of your next turn.")
B.aCv=new A.d5("universal_fire","Fire","On Success, give the targets {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex. You may give yourself {Vitality}d6 Burn to increase the burn against the targets by the same amount.")
B.aCC=new A.d5("universal_gravity","Gravity","On Success, Before or after any other effects, either dash one of the targets to a free space within {Half Source} of them, or dash you and allies within 1 to a free space within {Half Source}.")
B.aCs=new A.d5("universal_hate","Hate","On Success, you may deal yourself up to {Source d12} damage to increase the damage to the targets by the same amount.")
B.aCl=new A.d5("universal_inspiring","Inspiring","After you Succeed with the attack, 1 ally within 6 spaces gains {Source d6} Shield.")
B.aCx=new A.d5("universal_illness","Illness","On Success, give one of the targets {Half Source} d6 bleed, While they have this bleed, their speed is reduced by {Half Source}. You may give yourself this bleed, if you do also give it to enemies range 1 of you.")
B.aCE=new A.d5("universal_jamming","Jamming","After you Success with the attack, and if the target was concentrating, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage. The target has disadvantage on their concentration check for this attack. If the target begins concentrating before the start of your next turn, they must immediately make a concentration check as if they had taken damage.")
B.aCw=new A.d5("universal_life","Life","On Success, Target an ally range 3 and heal them {Half Source d6}.")
B.aCG=new A.d5("universal_lightning","Lightning","On Success, Knock the targets prone and Deal {Half Source d6} damage to all prone enemies within 3 of the targets excluding the targets. If the targets were prone before the attack, damage them as well.")
B.aCB=new A.d5("universal_power_attack","Power Attack","You may gain disadvantage on the attack and deal {Source d6} extra damage on success. If you do, you must roll with disadvantage even if you have advantage.")
B.aCI=new A.d5("universal_pull","Pull","After you Success with an attack, the attack pulls enemies toward you {2*Source} for melee attacks and {Source} for ranged attacks.")
B.aCt=new A.d5("universal_push","Push","After you Succeed with an attack, You may push an enemy up to {2*Source} for melee attacks and {Source} for ranged attacks.")
B.aCD=new A.d5("universal_rainbow","Rainbow","When you make the attack, you may choose to target any defense.")
B.aCp=new A.d5("universal_reaching","Reaching","Increase the range of the ability attack by {Half Source}.")
B.aCk=new A.d5("universal_reckless","Reckless","you may gain advantage on attacks and disadvantage on defenses until the start of your next turn.")
B.aCr=new A.d5("universal_scratch","Scratch","When you miss with a Melee Attack, Deal the target {Source /3 d6} Damage.")
B.aCK=new A.d5("universal_skirmish","Skirmish","After you make an attack, until the end of your turn, you may move without provoking attacks of opportunity.")
B.aCL=new A.d5("universal_slowing","Slowing","On Success, the targets reduce their speed by {Half Source}, and reduce their range with ranged Attacks by {Half Source} until the start of your next turn.")
B.aCF=new A.d5("universal_water","Water","On Success, Until the start of your next turn, your allies deal {Half Source d6} extra damage on attacks or damaging Status Checks against the targets.")
B.aCJ=new A.d5("universal_weed","Weed","On Success, Before or after any of the other effects, place difficult terrain in the targets\u2019 spaces.")
B.aCz=new A.d5("universal_wind","Wind","On Success, After attacking, Dash you and the targets up to {Half Source} in the same direction.")
