B.a02=new A.aw("feature_forced_martyrdom","Forced Martyrdom","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Wis targeting an enemy range 1. On Success, Deal {source d8} Damage and you resist all damage from attacks. When you take damage the target takes the same amount. At the start of your turn, make an Status Check vs the target\u2019s Wis, On Success, they continue to be affected, on Miss the effect ends.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on an attack or an ally fails on an attack, spend your reaction and target one of the targets of the triggering attack. Deal {Half Source d8} damage vs Wis and you resist all damage from attacks and when you take damage the target takes the same amount. At the start of your turn, make an Status Check vs the target\u2019s Wis, On Success, they continue to be affected, on Problems the effect ends.\n\nIf you have multiple targets affected by this at once, choose when you take damage which target takes the damage with you.",B.P,B.ab9,!1,B.qZ,!0,null,null)
B.VW=new A.D("feature_illusions_behind_the_curtain","Behind the Curtain","You and your allies can move through your illusions without breaking them. You and your allies may end your turn inside your illusion walls, preventing them from being able to be targeted by enemies as long as there is an illusion. If an enemy would be able to target a creature under your illusion with an ability, they can target the illusions in the spaces instead.")
B.XB=new A.D("feature_illusions_disillusionment","Disillusionment","When an enemy destroys one of your illusions, make a status check vs Int. On success, deal {Source d6} damage to the destroying enemy.")
B.TX=new A.D("feature_illusions_smoke_and_mirrors","Smoke and Mirrors","When an enemy destroys one of your illusions, you or your allies adjacent to the illusions gain +1 to defense results until the start of their next turn. [Reaction] When you or your allies are adjacent to an illusion and are targeted by an attack, they can spend their reaction to force them to target the illusion instead.")
B.Ya=new A.D("feature_illusions_unnerving_movement","Unnerving Movement","While concentrating, at the start of any turn, spend your [Reaction] target 1 illusion and move it {Source} spaces then make a status check vs Int targeting enemies range {Source} of the illusion. On success, deal {Source d6} damage.")
B.acz=s([B.VW,B.XB,B.TX,B.Ya],t.U)
B.a_R=new A.aw("feature_illusions","Illusions","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Int: On a Success, create up to {Source} spaces worth of illusions that last as long as you remain concentrating. Each space of illusions follows the wall rules from skills. You may create barriers instead of walls, creating 2 spaces of barrier for 1 space of wall. Your illusions are destroyed when hit by a single attack. You and your allies may move through your illusions causing them to be destroyed.\n\n[Reaction] At the Start of a turn, spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int. On Success, create up to {Source} Spaces worth of illusions.\n\nWhile concentrating, if you activate the ability, you may add new illusions to the concentration. ",B.P,B.acz,!1,B.es,!0,null,null)
B.VU=new A.D("feature_inspiration_rage","Rage","When an ally fails on an attack, defense, or skill using inspiration, deal {Source d6} damage targeting an enemy range 1 of them or you.")
B.VM=new A.D("feature_inspiration_hope","Hope","When an ally succeeds on a defense using inspiration, give you and your allies {Half Source d6} shield.")
B.Xc=new A.D("feature_inspiration_valor","Valor","Once each round, after you are damaged by an attack, each of your allies with inspiration gains {Source/3 d6} shield.")
