B.a00=new A.aw("feature_mind_control","Mind Control","[Action] make a Ranged Attack vs Int against 1 enemy range {Source}. On success, for as long as you remain concentrating you are disabled and the target is mind controlled. At the start of their turn, make a status check vs Int, on success you control them on their turn. On failure the enemy is disabled this turn and the effect ends. \n\n[Reaction] When you or an Ally Succeed on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int. On Success, 1 of the targets is mind controlled as long as you concentrate.",B.P,B.afC,!1,B.ze,!0,null,null)
B.WG=new A.D("feature_minkisi_witch_doctor","Witch Doctor","While concentrating, During your turn [Reaction] if the target is under a status effect that requires an ongoing check, have the target immediately make the check with advantage. The target may instead end burn or bleed. If the target is targeted by a poppet ability, the source of the poppet must make a concentration check.")
