B.a0z=new A.aw("feature_mirror_self","Mirror Self","[Action] Make {Source} copies of yourself that appear adjacent to you and last for as long as you remain concentrating. Whenever an attack targets you or a clone, you may choose to make a defense like normal or have the clone break. If broken, the clone is destroyed and the attack is otherwise ignored and the attacker takes {Half Source d6} damage. At the start of your turn, pick any of the copies to play out your turn from and you may move all your clones up to your speed whenever you move. Clones damaged from provoked attacks on your turn are destroyed instead of rolling to see who is hit, dealing {Half Source d6} damage to the attacker. If an attack targets multiple of your clones you can only defend for 1 of them.\n\n[Reaction] Before you make a defense check that isn\u2019t a Vitality Defense, Spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int. On Success, You succeed the defense check and the attacker takes {Source d6}, On Problems you fail the defense.",B.aE,B.abt,!1,B.es,!0,null,null)
B.XM=new A.D("feature_mischief_Cuteify","Cuteify","On Success with the action, on the start of target\u2019s turn make a status check vs cha, on success the target is disabled and the effect continues. On failure the effect ends.")
