B.Mz=new A.fM("Cold","Combat: Give the targets {Level /3} Cold. Adventuring: Freeze a surface or the floor of a room making it slippery.","Give the targets {Level /3} Cold.","Freeze a surface or the floor of a room making it slippery.")
B.Mv=new A.fM("Fire","Combat: Give the targets {Half Level} d6 Burn. Adventuring: Touch an object causing it to burst into flames.","Give the targets {Half Level} d6 Burn.","Touch an object causing it to burst into flames.")
