B.MB=new A.fM("Wind","Combat: After attacking, Dash you and the targets of the attack up to {Half Level} in the same direction. Adventuring: Cause a gust of wind strong enough to knock a person over for a few seconds.","After attacking, Dash you and the targets of the attack up to {Half Level} in the same direction.","Cause a gust of wind strong enough to knock a person over for a few seconds.")
B.Mt=new A.fM("Water","Combat: Until the start of your next turn, your allies deal {Half Level} d6 extra damage on attacks or damaging Status Checks against the targets. Adventuring: After an ally fails a check, give them some water and they gain a +1 to all checks to solve the problem caused by their check.","Until the start of your next turn, your allies deal {Half Level} d6 extra damage on attacks or damaging Status Checks against the targets.","After an ally fails a check, give them some water and they gain a +1 to all checks to solve the problem caused by their check.")
B.MA=new A.fM("Earth","Combat: The target's speed is reduced by {Half Level}. Adventuring: You can move 4 cubic meters of dirt and stone and can use a create skill to form it into anything that could be made of either.","The target's speed is reduced by {Half Level}.","You can move 4 cubic meters of dirt and stone and can use a create skill to form it into anything that could be made of either.")
B.Mx=new A.fM("Death","Combat: Deal the damage of the attack to an untargeted enemy range 6 of one of the targets. Adventuring: Ask 3 questions of a recently dead body, the body answers truthfully but only what it experienced since it was spawned.","Deal the damage of the attack to an untargeted enemy range 6 of one of the targets.","Ask 3 questions of a recently dead body, the body answers truthfully but only what it experienced since it was spawned.")
B.MC=new A.fM("Life","Combat: Target an ally range 3 and heal them {Half Level d6}. Adventuring: Treat 1 exhaustion.","Target an ally range 3 and heal them {Half Level d6}.","Treat 1 exhaustion.")
B.Mu=new A.fM("Lightning","Combat: Target all enemies within 3 of any of the targets excluding the targets. Deal {Half Level d6} damage to all prone enemies and otherwise knock them prone. Adventuring: Zap a person or device with electricity momentarily stunning it.","Target all enemies within 3 of any of the targets excluding the targets. Deal {Half Level d6} damage to all prone enemies and otherwise knock them prone.","Zap a person or device with electricity momentarily stunning it.")
B.My=new A.fM("Rainbow","Combat: Before the target makes an attack vs the chosen defense, they may choose to target any defense with a +1 to success. Adventuring: You may spend a usage to let yourself or allies you can see, reroll any skill or defense that was a d4 or d6, or if it is their lowest skill or defense rating.","Before the target makes an attack vs the chosen defense, they may choose to target any defense with a +1 to success.","You may spend a usage to let yourself or allies you can see, reroll any skill or defense that was a d4 or d6, or if it is their lowest skill or defense rating.")
