B.Rf=new A.bV("melee_berserker","Berserker","On Player Failure, Knock the target prone, deal {Level /3l d6} extra damage, and Until the start of their next turn, the chump has resistance to all damage. When an enemy starts or becomes in range, [Reaction] and makes a Berserker attack.",B.c5,B.d1)
B.R5=new A.bV("melee_challenger","Challenger","On Player Failure, the target cannot disengage and must include this unit as a target of all attacks or suffer disadvantage on their next turn. On Failure, Target a player that they can see and have them make a Wis defense, On Player Failure, they are challenged as if attacked.",B.c5,B.d1)
B.R7=new A.bV("melee_defender","Defender","On Player Failure, players have -1 to attacks against this chump and their adjacent allies until the start of their next turn. On Player Success, players have -1 to attack against this chump's allies who are range 1 of this defender.",B.c5,B.d1)
B.Ru=new A.bV("melee_feasting","Feasting","On Player Failure, Heal half the damage they deal and knock the target prone. If the target dies or the first time they feast on a dead body, heal the full amount.\n[Reaction] When an enemy dies or is knocked prone within half speed, dash to a space adjacent to the target and make a Feasting Attack against the target or an enemy range 1.",B.c5,B.d1)
B.Rb=new A.bV("melee_frozen","Frozen","On Player Failure, The target and enemies adjacent to either the target or you, gains {Third Level} Cold.\n[Reaction] When a Player Succeeds an attack against the chump and they resist the damage, give {Quarter Level} cold to enemies adjacent to the chump.",B.c5,B.d1)
B.Rn=new A.bV("melee_guard","Guard","On Player Failure, During the target's next turn their speed is 0.\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts or becomes adjacent, make the guard attack, the effect applies to their current turn.",B.c5,B.d1)
B.Ri=new A.bV("melee_paladin","Paladin","On Player Failure, heal an ally equal to half the damage dealt.\n[Reaction] During an adjacent ally's turn, you may reduce this chump's HP and give it to that ally.",B.c5,B.d1)
B.Rg=new A.bV("melee_stampeding","Stampeding","Instead, Move up to half their speed, moving through enemies. Each target makes a Dex Defense, On Player Failure, they take {Damage} and are knocked prone.\n[Reaction] After a Player Succeeds an Attack against them, you may have them stamped.",B.c5,B.d1)
B.R3=new A.bV("melee_valorous","Valorous","On Player Failure, this chump resists all damage.\n[Reaction] When an ally range {Level} is successfully attacked and that attack didn't include this chump as a target, this chump takes the damage instead of the target. Effects still target the original character.",B.c5,B.d1)
