B.Rd=new A.bV("melee_grabber","Grabber","On Player Failure, the target is grappled.\n[Reaction] The first time each turn, a player starts their turn in range or enters range during any turn, making a grabbing attack.",B.c5,B.di)
B.Rs=new A.bV("melee_scoundrel","Scoundrel","On Player Failure, Half the targets speed and knock them prone.\n[Reaction] The first time an enemy starts or becomes range 3 during their turn, make a scoundrel attack against the target.",B.c5,B.di)
B.QZ=new A.bV("melee_toxic","Toxic","On Player Failure, The target gain {Level/3} d8 Burn vs Vit, While they have this burn, halve their speed.\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends in range 3 during their turn, make a toxic attack against the target.",B.c5,B.di)
