B.Rp=new A.bV("melee_flurry","Flurry","Instead, target all adjacent enemies.\n[Reaction] When an enemy ends their turn in range, make a Flurry Attack.",B.c5,B.cr)
B.R8=new A.bV("melee_bloody","Bloody","On Player Failure, the target gain {Half Level} d6 Bleed, and You may deal {Half Level d6} damage to the chump to give all enemies adjacent to the target or the chump {Half Level} d6 bleed.\n[Reaction] At the end of a turn, you may deal {Half Level d6} damage to the chump and give all enemies adjacent to them {Half Level} d6 Bleed.",B.c5,B.cr)
B.RK=new A.bV("melee_ignitor","Ignitor","On Player Failure, the target gain {Half Level] d6 Burn vs Dex.\n[Reaction] At the end of the round, give the chump and all characters range 3 of them {Level} d6 burn.",B.c5,B.cr)
B.RH=new A.bV("melee_parasite","Parasite","On Player Failure, instead give the target {Half Level} d6 Bleed then the chump attaches to the Target. While attached, players cannot target the chump and the chump shares a space with the target. The Chump heals half of all bleed damage the target takes. At the Start of the Target's turn, they must make a Vit Defense. On Player Failure, they take {Basic Damage} damage and gain 1 d6 Bleed. On Player Success, the effect ends and the chump is in an adjacent location.\n[Reaction] The first time each turn, a player starts their turn in range or enters range during any turn, making a parasite attack.",B.c5,B.cr)
