B.R0=new A.bV("ranged_disabler","Disabler","On Player Failure, the target is disabled during their next turn.\n[Reaction] When a player ends their turn in range 6, Make the Disabler attack.",B.dQ,B.di)
B.Ry=new A.bV("ranged_jammer","Jammer","On Player Failure, enemies within 6 of the unit have -1 to all dice checks. On player success when in the short range, the target has -1 to all dice checks",B.dQ,B.di)
B.Rj=new A.bV("ranged_blasting","Blasting","Regardless of success, push the target {Half Level}.",B.dQ,B.di)
B.Rk=new A.bV("ranged_mind_control","Mind Control","On Player Failure, deal half damage and the target is mind controlled. On their next turn, they must attack one of their allies using one of their features.\n[Reaction] When an ally range 6 succeeds in an attack, make the target make a Wis Defense. On Player Failure, the target is mind controlled.",B.dQ,B.di)
B.Ra=new A.bV("ranged_sniper","Sniper","On Player Success, deal half damage.\n[Reaction] When a player first enters or starts in range, make an attack.",B.dQ,B.cr)
