B.aDv=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_shotgun","ShotGun",B.bf,"Being adjacent to enemies does not give you disadvantage with Shotgun, but allies provide cover to enemies. When the target is at short range, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.","3 / 6","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
B.aDt=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_rifle","Rifle",B.bf,"On Success, If you haven't moved or dashed this turn, deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.","10 / 20","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
B.aDf=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_carbine","Carbine",B.bf,"On Success, If the target was successfully attack by your ally this round, Deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.","6 / 12","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
B.aDe=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_Machine_Gun","Machine Gun",B.bf,"On Success, you may divide your damage dice between enemies within 2 of the target. Apply on attack effects only to the target.","6 / 12","{Source d6}","{2 * Source d6}","Dex")
B.aDy=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_LongBow","LongBow",B.bf,"Make a Brute (skill) check instead of an Attack roll to determine a Successful Attack.","8 / 16","None","{Source d10}","Dex")
B.aDx=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_Bow_Tsukubai","Bow, Tsukubai",B.bf,"You may spend half your speed and gain advantage to Range Attack Defenses until the start of your next turn.","6 / 12","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
B.aDi=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_Bow_Sword_in_Hand","Bow, Sword in Hand",B.bf,"On Success, you may move up to half your speed, then activate a 1 Handed Melee Weapon Technique paying its costs as normal.","6 / 12","{Source d6}","None","Dex")
B.aDn=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_Bow_Burst","Bow, Burst Shooting",B.bf,"Target {Source/3} targets and make an attack and damage roll against each. You may target the same creature multiple times. You cannot take multiple shots if restrained, or if an enemy is adjacent to you.","6 / 12","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
B.aDC=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_Bow_Horseback","Bow, Horseback",B.bf,'"Before attacking, dash you and your mount 1 space. On Problems, Any creature that could have made an attack of opportunity if you moved instead of dash may do so.\nOn Success, You may move your mount {Source} spaces.\nYou ignore ranged attack penalty from moving too far on a mount."',"6 / 12","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
B.aDg=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_crossbow","Crossbow",B.bf,"You have advantage on attacks within the short range when targeting non adjacent enemies. Deal {Half Source d6} extra damage when firing over a barrier. You must Ready your crossbow to use it again by spending an action or reaction during your turn. Your crossbow starts ready unless jumped or surprised.","5 / 10","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
B.aDo=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_Magnum_Revolver","Magnum Revolver",B.bf,"","5 / 10","{Source d10}","{Source d12}","Dex")
B.aDz=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_Holdout","Holdout",B.bf,"When Attacking through an adjacent ally, gain a +1 to attack results.","4 / 8","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
B.aDd=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_Catapult","Catapult",B.bf,"Target creatures in a 1 space radius. [Reaction] During yours or allies turns, Launch a willing adjacent creature to a free space within {Source}.","6 / 12","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
B.aDb=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_Cannon","Cannon",B.bf,"On Success, you and your allies deal {Half Source d6} bonus damage on Attacks that target Str or Vitality until the end of your next turn.","6 / 12","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Dex")
B.aD6=new A.bS("weapon_ranged_Squirt_Gun","Squirt Gun",B.bf,"On Success, you also target creatures in a line between you and the target.","5 / 10","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
